I can't vouch for Stealth, haven't tried it myself.

If you're life isn't threatened right now then let's move slowly.
Getting a mirror will help. Nymphs occasionally carry one. The oracle
would tell you that applying a mirror to yourself while blinded may
reveal the location of powerful humans, in relation to you, in the
dungeon. Of course, being blind is part of a solution in itself.
They say that Medusa is a nymph but she doesn't carry a mirror.

BTW, you can safely go down the stairs. The problem here is that
if you then enter the Medusa's level you have to worry about randomly
teleporting to her vicinity. Take it slow and increase your odds
of acquiring appropriate magic. I'm assuming you're telepathic and
invisible (you said you were having a great game). Dragons can see
invisible and so will seek you but you can avoid missile attacks by
staying out of a direct line of sight until the dragon is adjacent
to you. Then again you might want a blue dragon to attack you. Don't
forget Elbereth, most monsters don't. As a barbarian you know that
monsters make great meals so you shouldn't go hungry.

